title: Crow's Foot
text: The PRISM splits white light into red, green and blue, and sends each colour off at its own angle. Hit it at a slant and give the crow three toes.
trick: split
motif: bird's footprint
ink: 2.5
expect: recolours>=1
---
L 5 14 0 w
*B 5 11 5 k
*P 7 9 4 k
T 7 5 0 ?
T 10 6 0 ?
T 4 6 0 ?
T 7 3 0 ?   % the middle toe is the longest
